diff --git a/docs/design/streaming_weight_loading.md b/docs/design/streaming_weight_loading.md
index 8fb55df61..1d85ccfe1 100644
--- a/docs/design/streaming_weight_loading.md
+++ b/docs/design/streaming_weight_loading.md
@@ -1,5 +1,9 @@
 # Proposal: bounded streaming weight loading
 
+In this tree the `b12x` load format and its adapter are gone: `--load-format
+direct` (`vllm/model_executor/model_loader/direct_loader.py`) is the bounce-ring
+path below, ported into vLLM. The rest of this proposal is kept as written.
+
 Status: the C99 O_DIRECT transport and b12x vLLM adapter load ordinary
 PyTorch CUDA tensors. The loader owns bounded I/O buffers and retains destination
 references until completion. Models use their normal allocation paths.
